{"unit_id": "3579715199:DESCRIPTION:1362:1442", "sku": "3579715199", "surface": "DESCRIPTION", "source_file": "01_Карточки/Ozon/МегаФон/П01 APPIX Pro/3579715199/CS_a7f235114b63f890695e/01_Материалы/card_data.json", "source_field": "description", "start": 1362, "end": 1442, "text": "• Скачать приложение оператора в Google Play, AppStore, App Gallery или RuStore.", "offset_unit": "UNICODE_CODE_POINT", "unit_kind": "SOURCE_SEGMENT", "atomicity": "SOURCE_SEGMENT_NOT_ASSUMED_SINGLE_PROPOSITION"}
{"unit_id": "3579715199:DESCRIPTION:1444:1485", "sku": "3579715199", "surface": "DESCRIPTION", "source_file": "01_Карточки/Ozon/МегаФон/П01 APPIX Pro/3579715199/CS_a7f235114b63f890695e/01_Материалы/card_data.json", "source_field": "description", "start": 1444, "end": 1485, "text": "• Выбрать пункт \"Активировать SIM-карту\".", "offset_unit": "UNICODE_CODE_POINT", "unit_kind": "SOURCE_SEGMENT", "atomicity": "SOURCE_SEGMENT_NOT_ASSUMED_SINGLE_PROPOSITION"}
